  "title": "Plug Power CEO, Marsh, to purchase PLUG common stock",
  "summary": "“My optimism about the fuel cell industry continues to grow, and I look forward in increasing my position in the industry’s undeniable leader,” said Plug Power’s CEO, Andy Marsh. “The world is going electric – and Plug Power is at the forefront of defining the place for hydrogen fuel cells. Now is the time.“ […]",
